# Copy to .env (git-ignored; `nuxt dev` does not read .env.local) and paste your key.
# Get a license key from the Kernstra console: https://console.kernstra.com
# A development key watermarks every page and runs on any host, localhost included.
# In production, set NUXT_PUBLIC_KERNSTRA_LICENSE in the server's environment instead.
NUXT_PUBLIC_KERNSTRA_LICENSE=
